{"id":"b9ec54437321db8d","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model.md","title":"Cresswell Model for Henkin Logic","display":"ex-cresswell-henkin-model — Cresswell Model for Henkin Logic","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model","aliases":["89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model"],"display":"ex-cresswell-henkin-model — Cresswell Model for Henkin Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-cresswell-henkin-model — Cresswell Model for Henkin Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" href=\"?note=5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" title=\"89-df-henkin-modal-logic\">89-df-henkin-modal-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\(W=\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 始终表示自然数，普通世界写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,0)\">\\((n,0)\\)</span>；星号世界采用下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^*\">\\(n^*\\)</span>，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 重定义为有序对。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 为下面给出的单个模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_H\">\\(\\mathcal A_H\\)</span> 是正规 Henkin 逻辑的公理实例集；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span> 均为自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cresswell\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nn^*&amp;\\coloneqq(n,1)\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\nR\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{((m,1),(n,1))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m\\le n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{((m,1),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{((m,0),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m&gt;n\\},\\\\\nV(q)\\coloneqq{}&amp;W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A,\\\\\n&amp;M,2^*\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,2^*\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cresswell\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nn^*&amp;\\coloneqq(n,1)\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\nR\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{((m,1),(n,1))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m\\le n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{((m,1),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{((m,0),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m&gt;n\\},\\\\\nV(q)\\coloneqq{}&amp;W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A,\\\\\n&amp;M,2^*\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,2^*\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\coloneqq(W,R,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\coloneqq(W,R,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 11 章，pp.151–153，Cresswell 对 Magari 模型的简化及 Theorem 2。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq W\">\\(X\\subseteq W\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(X)=\\{w\\in W\\mid\\forall v(wRv\\to v\\in X)\\}\">\\(B(X)=\\{w\\in W\\mid\\forall v(wRv\\to v\\in X)\\}\\)</span>。有限或余有限集合对布尔运算闭合。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 漏掉普通世界，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是最小的被遗漏自然数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(X)=\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\(B(X)=\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span>。若全部普通世界都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为有限或余有限，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 必为余有限：遗漏星号世界为空时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(X)=W\">\\(B(X)=W\\)</span>，否则令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^*\">\\(k^*\\)</span> 为最大的遗漏世界，有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(X)=W\\setminus\\{0^*,\\ldots,(k+1)^*\\}\">\\(B(X)=W\\setminus\\{0^*,\\ldots,(k+1)^*\\}\\)</span>。由公式结构归纳，每个真值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]\">\\([A]\\)</span> 都有限或余有限。</p>\n<p>验证 Henkin 模式时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是最小的普通假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 世界，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\land\\neg A\">\\(\\Box A\\land\\neg A\\)</span>；能满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\">\\(\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\)</span> 的世界不能通向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，只可能是普通世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\le m\">\\(w\\le m\\)</span>，这些世界均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span>。若普通世界均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，但仍有假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的星号世界，取最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^*\">\\(k^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)^*\">\\((k+1)^*\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land\\neg\\Box A\">\\(A\\land\\neg\\Box A\\)</span>，每个不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 的世界都通向它，故不满足 Henkin 模式的前提。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]=W\">\\([A]=W\\)</span>，结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 直接为真。由此覆盖全部公式。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}\">\\([p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*\\}\">\\([\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Box\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*,2^*\\}\">\\([\\Box\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*,2^*\\}\\)</span>，给出所示见证。所有 Henkin 公理实例在这个固定赋值模型的全部世界成立；MP 和必然化保持这种全世界真，故 H 的全部定理都在 M 中真。这里没有断言底层框架在所有赋值下验证 H；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 含有自环，该框架不是 GL 框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-henkin-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5ed2b55b4cca2b52","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W=\\omega\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(n,0)","display":false},{"tex":"n^*","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_H","display":false},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cresswell\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nn^*&\\coloneqq(n,1)\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\nR\\coloneqq{}&\\{((m,1),(n,1))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m\\le n+1\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{((m,1),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{((m,0),(n,0))\\mid m,n\\in\\omega,\\ m>n\\},\\\\\nV(q)\\coloneqq{}&W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A,\\\\\n&M,2^*\\models\\Box p,\\qquad M,2^*\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M\\coloneqq(W,R,V).","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"B(X)=\\{w\\in W\\mid\\forall v(wRv\\to v\\in X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"B(X)=\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B(X)=W","display":false},{"tex":"k^*","display":false},{"tex":"B(X)=W\\setminus\\{0^*,\\ldots,(k+1)^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\land\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"w\\le m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"k^*","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)^*","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land\\neg\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"[A]=W","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"[p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Box\\Box p]=W\\setminus\\{0^*,1^*,2^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":2973,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 给出 H 不证明 4 的具体见证。"}],"outgoing":["ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0","5ed2b55b4cca2b52"]}